Subject: [PATCH 7/9] feat: soften interface colors with an accessible pastel
 palette

From: Codex <codex@localhost>

Use pastel blue, mint, peach and rose accents across themes, charts and public status pages. Pair pastel control fills with dark text and switch thumbs. Sixteen text color combinations meet 4.5:1 contrast. TypeScript, custom runtime tests and desktop/mobile browser checks passed.
